    "description": {
      "value": "You spent years working as a clerk to a functionary in Absalom's government. Your service taught you a thing or two about rousing speeches and manipulating the city's bureaucracy.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Charisma or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Government Lore skill. You gain the Group Impression skill feat."
